<html lang='en'>
  <head>
    <meta charset='UTF-8' />
    <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0' />
    <title>New Features in EngageGPT</title>
    <style>
      body { margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f5f7fa; font-family:
      'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; color: #333; }
      .email-wrapper { max-width: 640px; margin: 40px auto; background: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); overflow:
      hidden; } .email-header { background-color: #0c4a6e; color: #ffffff;
      text-align: center; padding: 30px 20px; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 600;
      } .email-body { padding: 30px 25px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7; }
      .feature-list { margin: 24px 0; padding-left: 0; list-style: none; }
      .feature-list li { padding: 12px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; } 
      .feature-title { font-weight: 600; color: #0c4a6e; } .cta-container {
      text-align: center; margin: 30px 0 10px 0; } .cta-button {
      background-color: #007bff; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; padding:
      14px 28px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; border-radius: 6px;
      display: inline-block; transition: background 0.3s ease; }
      .cta-button:hover { background-color: #0056b3; } .email-footer {
      background-color: #f0f2f5; padding: 20px; text-align: center; font-size:
      13px; color: #777; border-top: 1px solid #e1e1e1; } .email-footer a {
      color: #0c4a6e; text-decoration: none; margin: 0 6px; } @media (max-width:
      600px) { .email-body { padding: 20px 15px; } .email-header { font-size:
      20px; padding: 20px 15px; } .cta-button { padding: 12px 20px; font-size:
      15px; } }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class='email-wrapper'>
      <div class='email-header'>
        🚀 New Features Just Dropped!
      </div>
      <div class='email-body'>
        <p>Hi <strong>{{name}}</strong>,</p>
        <p>We’ve been working hard at EngageGPT, and we’re excited to announce
          the latest features just added to your dashboard:</p>

        <ul class='feature-list'>
          {{#each features}}
            <li>
              <span class='feature-title'>{{this.title}}</span><br />
              {{this.description}}
            </li>
          {{/each}}
        </ul>

        <div class='cta-container'>
          <a
            href='https://engagegpt.in/dashboard'
            target='_blank'
            class='cta-button'
          >Try Them Out Now</a>
        </div>

        <p>Got feedback or ideas? Reply to this email — we’d love to hear from
          you!</p>
        <p>Cheers,<br />The EngageGPT Team</p>
      </div>
      <div class='email-footer'>
        &copy;
        {{year}}
        EngageGPT. All rights reserved.<br />
        <a href='https://engagegpt.in'>Website</a>
        |
        <a href='mailto:engagegpt@gmail.com'>Support</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>